WEBVTT

00:02:29.579 --> 00:02:31.538
a way that makes our work better.

00:02:38.996 --> 00:02:42.288
Hello, everyone, so Abana

00:02:45.038 --> 00:02:49.496
in South Africa, where I come from, so
Bonner is the Zulu word for hello.

00:02:50.788 --> 00:02:53.121
There's a beautiful and powerful
intention behind the word

00:02:53.121 --> 00:02:57.663
because subunit means I see you. And by
seeing you, I bring you into being.

00:02:59.204 --> 00:03:01.913
So beautiful, imagine being
greeted like that.